@API_Gateway_HostAddress = http://localhost:5034

### Gateway Health Check
GET {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Gateway Ready Check
GET {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/ready
Accept: application/json

###

### Gateway Info
GET {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

###

### Login via Gateway (v1)
POST {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@authsystem.local",
  "password": "Admin@123!",
  "applicationCode": "AUTH_SYSTEM"
}

###

### Refresh Token via Gateway (v1)
POST {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "your-refresh-token-here"
}

###

### Logout via Gateway (v1)
POST {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here

{
  "refreshToken": "your-refresh-token-here"
}

###

### Get Current User (v1)
GET {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here

###

### ==========================================
### Applications via Gateway (v1)
### ==========================================

### List Applications
GET {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/applications
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here

###

### Get Application by ID
GET {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/applications/your-application-id-here
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here

###

### Create Application
POST {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here

{
  "name": "My Application",
  "code": "MY_APP",
  "description": "A sample application"
}

###

### ==========================================
### Organizations via Gateway (v1)
### ==========================================

### List Organizations
GET {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/organizations
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here

###

### Get Organization by ID
GET {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/organizations/your-organization-id-here
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here

###

### Create Organization
POST {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/organizations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here

{
  "name": "My Organization",
  "slug": "my-org"
}

###

### Get Organization Members
GET {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/organizations/your-organization-id-here/members
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here

###

### Invite Member to Organization
POST {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/organizations/your-organization-id-here/invitations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here

{
  "email": "newmember@example.com",
  "role": "Member"
}

###

### ==========================================
### Invitations via Gateway (v1)
### ==========================================

### Accept Organization Invitation
POST {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/invitations/your-invitation-token-here/accept
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here

###

### ==========================================
### Audit Logs via Gateway (v1)
### ==========================================

### List Audit Logs
GET {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/audit-logs
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here

###

### Get Audit Log by ID
GET {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/audit-logs/your-audit-log-id-here
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here

###

### Export Audit Logs
POST {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/audit-logs/export
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here

{
  "format": "csv"
}

###

### ==========================================
### Admin Secrets via Gateway (v1)
### ==========================================

### Get Secrets Status
GET {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/secrets/status
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here

###

### Generate RSA Key Pair
POST {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/secrets/generate/rsa
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here

###

### ==========================================
### Discovery via Gateway
### ==========================================

### OIDC Discovery via Gateway
GET {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/.well-known/openid-configuration
Accept: application/json

###

### JWKS via Gateway
GET {{API_Gateway_HostAddress}}/.well-known/jwks.json
Accept: application/json

###
